 3c --\u003e|sends digests to| 3b\n    3b --\u003e|pins via manager| 1e\n    \n    3e --\u003e|triggers unpin| 3f\n    3f --\u003e|unpins via manager| 2e\n    \n    6a --\u003e|enumerates| 6b\n    6b --\u003e|checks| CAS\n    6c --\u003e|attempts| 6d\n    6d --\u003e|rejects pinned| 6e\n    6d --\u003e|deletes unpinned| 6f\n    \n    style Config fill:#ffec99\n    style CLI fill:#fcc2d7\n    style Memory fill:#b2f2bb\n    style Cache fill:#a5d8ff\n    style ArtifactMgr fill:#d0bfff\n    style CAS fill:#ffd8a8\n    style GC fill:#eebefa"
